WEBVTT

00:21:00.163 --> 00:21:04.538
Not try to influence people to do
the work. Does that make sense?

00:21:04.538 --> 00:21:07.454
It does. It does. And to me,

00:21:07.454 --> 00:21:12.496
what's so clever about that approach is it
takes the leader out of the spotlight

00:21:12.496 --> 00:21:15.913
a little bit. Right. So I'm not attacking
or criticizing my boss.

00:21:15.913 --> 00:21:19.996
I'm actually saying, hey, you know what a
lot of people are? I love your phrase.

00:21:19.996 --> 00:21:22.996
You know, the story I'm making
up is and here you're saying

00:21:23.246 --> 00:21:24.829
a lot of people are making
up different stories.

00:21:25.329 --> 00:21:29.538
And so, you know, maybe we need
to actually get the either set

00:21:29.538 --> 00:21:31.829
the record straight or learn from
something from this experience.